 # tally — split shared expenses between friends
+
+Groups, members, expenses split equally / by percentage / by exact amounts, payments,
+fixed exchange rates, balances and settle-up suggestions. Data lives in one JSON file.
+
+## Build and test
+
+Requires the .NET 8 SDK; no packages beyond FSharp.Core.
+
+```
+dotnet build src/Tally/Tally.fsproj
+dotnet run --project tests/Tally.Tests      # exits non-zero on failure
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+dotnet run --project src/Tally -- --help
+tally [--data FILE] group add trip EUR
+tally member add trip alice
+tally rate set trip USD 0.92
+tally expense trip alice 30 "Dinner" --split percent --shares alice=50,bob=50
+tally pay trip bob alice 15
+tally balances trip
+tally settle trip
+```
+
+The data file is `--data FILE`, else `$TALLY_DATA`, else `./tally.json`.
